==English==
[[Image:Comoros w2 locator.svg|thumb|right|Comoros on a globe.]]

===Etymology===
Likely borrowed via {{bor|en|fr|Comores}}. Ultimately from {{der|en|ar||جَزِيرَة القَمَر|tr=jazīrat al-qamar|t=island of the moon}}; for more see the etymology of {{m|en|Madagascar}}.
{{root|en|ar|ق م ر}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɒm.ə.ɹoʊz/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-Comoros.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=the Comoros}}

# {{sid|en|Q970}}{{place|en|A <<country>> and group of <<islands>> in the <<ocean/Indian Ocean>> off the coast of <<r/East Africa>>|official=Union of the Comoros}}.
# {{sid|en|Q634740}}{{place|en|archipelago|consisting of the [[Union of the Comoros]] and the [[French]] [[overseas department]] of [[Mayotte]]}}.

